"Sum of the per-prescription credit bases, without taxes: what the generated "
"credit-note lines will add up to."
msgstr ""
"Suma de les bases de crèdit per prescripció, sense impostos: el que sumaran"
" les línies de la rectificativa generada."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return.selection__spms_return_invoice_line__data_error_reason__diverged
msgid "Taxed amount inconsistent with the allowed amount"
msgstr "Import amb IVA incoherent amb l'import aprovat"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return_invoice.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The adjustment line product %(product)s must carry exactly one percentage "
"customer tax for company %(company)s."
msgstr ""
"El producte de la línia de desquadre %(product)s ha de portar exactament "
"un impost de client percentual per a l'empresa %(company)s."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return_invoice.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The confirmed official value %(value)s exceeds the total of the original "
"invoice %(invoice)s (%(total)s)."
msgstr ""
"El valor oficial confirmat %(value)s supera el total de la factura "
"original %(invoice)s (%(total)s)."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return_invoice.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The credit note total %(total).2f still differs from the official value "
"%(official).2f after imposing the tax amount."
msgstr ""
"El total de la rectificativa %(total).2f continua diferint del valor "
"oficial %(official).2f després d'imposar l'import de l'impost."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return_invoice.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The draft tax amount (%(draft).2f) differs from the expected tax "
"(%(expected).2f) for the taxes on its lines; review the tax configuration "
"before retrying."
msgstr ""
"L'import d'impostos de l'esborrany (%(draft).2f) difereix de l'impost "
"esperat (%(expected).2f) per als impostos de les seves línies; reviseu la "
"configuració d'impostos abans de reintentar."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return_invoice.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The draft untaxed total (%(draft).2f) differs from the prescription lines "
"total (%(expected).2f); review the draft lines before retrying."
msgstr ""
"La base imposable de l'esborrany (%(draft).2f) difereix del total de les "
"línies de prescripcions (%(expected).2f); reviseu les línies de "
"l'esborrany abans de reintentar."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The error file, period and date can only be changed on a draft SPMS return."
msgstr ""
"El fitxer d'errors, el període i la data només es poden canviar en un "
"retorn SPMS en esborrany."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "The error file contains no data rows."
msgstr "El fitxer d'errors no conté files de dades."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "The error file is empty."
msgstr "El fitxer d'errors és buit."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The following SPMS invoice numbers match more than one posted invoice: %s. "
"Fix the duplicated invoices before processing the return."
msgstr ""
"Els següents números de factura SPMS coincideixen amb més d'una factura "
"publicada: %s. Corregiu les factures duplicades abans de processar el retorn."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return_invoice.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "The invoice is no longer ready (current state: %s)."
msgstr "La factura ja no està preparada (estat actual: %s)."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return_invoice.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The official value of %s is already carried by a credit note; cancel that "
"credit note first to change it."
msgstr ""
"El valor oficial de %s ja està recollit en una factura rectificativa; "
"cancel·leu abans aquesta factura rectificativa per canviar-lo."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return_invoice.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "The original invoice %s is not posted."
msgstr "La factura original %s no està publicada."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return_invoice.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The remaining difference %(difference).2f between the official value "
"%(official).2f and the credit note total %(total).2f exceeds one rounding "
"step (%(step).2f); it cannot be absorbed by the imposed tax amount."
msgstr ""
"La diferència restant %(difference).2f entre el valor oficial "
"%(official).2f i el total de la rectificativa %(total).2f supera un pas "
"d'arrodoniment (%(step).2f); no es pot absorbir imposant l'import de "
"l'impost."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return_invoice.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The standard reversal did not create a single draft credit note for %s."
msgstr ""
"La reversió estàndard no ha creat un únic esborrany de rectificativa per a "
"%s."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return_invoice.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "There is no prescription with a positive difference."
msgstr "No hi ha cap prescripció amb diferència positiva."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "There is no ready (green) invoice to generate a credit note for."
msgstr ""
"No hi ha cap factura preparada (verda) per a la qual generar una "
"rectificativa."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return.selection__spms_return_invoice_line__data_error_reason__unconvertible
msgid "Unconvertible amount value"
msgstr "Valor d'import no convertible"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return/models/spms_return.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Upload the error file before processing %s."
msgstr "Pugeu el fitxer d'errors abans de processar %s."


#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_return.field_spms_return_invoice_line__data_error_reason
msgid "Why this line was marked as a data error when parsing the error file."
msgstr ""
"Per què aquesta línia es va marcar com a error de dades en processar el "
"fitxer d'errors."